			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* magnets now handshake between client and server to enable/disable themselves\n* magnets now properly render their model (no longer backwards)\n* magnets in the inventory now have an icon, and properly light up when being used.\n* when the mod is installed on both the client and server, magnet pulling is now predicted properly.\n* the server now handshakes with clients to only send extra item position packets for items who are being magnetized by a non-modded client. Every other entity only sends one every 20 ticks.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MelonMojito/Better-with-Magnets/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.2"
